            <title>[IGNITE-7412] WAL: Written bytes amount can be updated by wrong value and fail with assertion error</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/IGNITE-7412</link>
                <project id="12315922" key="IGNITE">Ignite</project>
